- Aura of Suffering self damage increased from 80% to 100%
==
==ability:shocking-reanimation:
[[/hero/victor?ability=shocking-reanimation]](([[!:https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/frank/frank_shocking_reanimation.webp]] Shocking Reanimation change history))
### [[/hero/victor?ability=shocking-reanimation]]((Shocking Reanimation))

- Shocking Reanimation rebirth health reduced from 100% to 60%
- Shocking Reanimation cooldown increased from 180s to 190s
- Shocking Reanimation T2 changed from "-20s Cooldown" to "+40% Rebirth Health"

- Shocking Reanimation attack damage no longer procs Lightning Scroll
